+## Money rules
+
+- Balances are stored as `Long` cents, never floating point.
+- Cross-currency transfers multiply by the treasury rate and round half to
+  even (banker's rounding).
+- Only the wallet owner, with the wallet PIN, can move money out of it.
+
+Run the tests with `./gradlew test`.
